OL,3,GNEWSAWhy another Wigan by-election is
OL,4,Abeing watched closely by political
OL,5,Aexperts
OL,6,
OL,7,FWorking away at the community garden at
OL,8,FTop Er't Sands in Hindley Green, Wigan,
OL,9,FChris Astbury says she is
OL,10,F"by-electioned out".
OL,12,FHindley Green was, back in the summer,
OL,13,Fone of a number of wards in the
OL,14,FMakerfield constituency that went to
OL,15,Fthe polls in what was one of the most
OL,16,Fclosely watched parliamentary
OL,17,Fby-elections of modern times.
OL,19,FAnd the contest that returned Andy
OL,20,FBurnham to Parliament was also arguably
OL,21,Fone of the most significant, given that
OL,22,Fwithin weeks he became prime minister.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
